# Keep text files in LF. CRLF makes gofmt rewrite Go files and prevents shell scripts from running on Linux.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Batch files keep CRLF, because cmd.exe reads a script by byte offset and an LF-only file can break goto.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

# Keep these binary assets out of line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
